  "details": "# Issue:\n\nThe hover animation of UI Elements, so the UI Element lifting up from the background / it getting bigger, can sometimes stop working. This mostly happens in bigger lists of UI Elements which you need to scroll through (E.g. the Friends or Worlds Wing).  \n\nI'm not sure exactly what causes this, but it usually happens when I'm drag scrolling through the lists.\n\n# Attachments:\n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/gkeitb.mp4",
